## 🎮 Controls

| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| **M** | Toggle Auto/Manual mode |
| **R** | Reset car position |
| **B** | Toggle bounding boxes |
| **Q** | Quit simulator |
| **Arrow Keys / WASD** | Manual driving (when in Manual mode) |

---

## 🧠 Deep Learning Concepts Used

| Concept | Application |
|---------|-------------|
| Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) | Lane detection using edge detection |
| Computer Vision | Object detection and bounding boxes |
| Reinforcement Learning (planned) | Decision making for braking/steering |
| Real-time Processing | 60 FPS continuous loop |

